5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We must verify external dependencies before committing to any new service lines.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I worry about who gets left behind when our opening hours shift.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,Funding structures often hide long-term liabilities that surface only after the vote.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,Why do we treat every proposal as novel when similar ones failed here?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I am concerned about adding tasks to staff who are already stretched thin.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@George, do the grant terms allow for contingency if suppliers fail?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@May, I agree. We need to know which stops actually worked before.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"@Ryuji, Yes, but only if we structure the endowment correctly from day one.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@Yumi, Exactly. The attendance sheets from former outreach stops are the key.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@George, I worry the endowment might not cover the training costs for new skills.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Daisuke, Training is internal, but delivery windows are external and volatile.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Ryuji, True. And winter road closures north of the river make delivery impossible.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,"@Yumi, That is a logistical barrier, but the financial barrier is more insidious.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"@George, Let’s look at the two programmes begun six years ago for comparison.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@May, I hope those programmes didn’t rely on volunteers without proper supervision.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will check the supplier delivery windows and the winter road closures.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I will look at the bus links and the former outreach attendance sheets.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,George,,I will examine the county grant terms and the running lines from last year.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,I will review the two old programmes and the volunteer register.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I will check the volunteer supervision training and the evening room bookings.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
